READ: if the mean is HIGH (>0.7) the within-year spread is mostly real land cover and the
it.72 caveat holds. If it is LOW or mixed, the green blocks MOVE between years, which land
cover cannot do over a few years - that would be spatially varying CAST, and no GRVI use,
within-year or across, is safe without normalisation.
